# Build context filter for containers/atrial_nnunet/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Only the inputs the Dockerfile copies are sent. nnU-Net predicts with checkpoint_final.pth,
# so the best-epoch checkpoints, validation outputs and training logs are left out (about 1.8 GB).
*
!containers/atrial_nnunet/
!containers/atrial_nnunet/**
!models/atrial_nnunet/
!models/atrial_nnunet/**
models/atrial_nnunet/**/checkpoint_best.pth
models/atrial_nnunet/**/validation/
models/atrial_nnunet/**/progress.png
models/atrial_nnunet/**/training_log_*.txt
!bin/
!bin/*.py
**/__pycache__/
**/*:Zone.Identifier
